# FREE DRUM  CIRCLE [![](/media/2012/11/Saturplay-NEW-10june2015-1.jpg)](/media/2012/11/Saturplay-NEW-10june2015-1.jpg)

Eats, Drinks, Drums and Good Vibes! This free drum circle is a community event where everyone can bring their own drum or grab one of ours and join us on the last Saturday of every month for a relaxed afternoon musical jam. All instruments are welcome and of course Rhythm Culture students and dancers will be there doing their 'thang'! Join the circle or sit back and enjoy the live musical jam. There will be cake, chai and good vibes available! .... AND BEAUTIFUL DINNER OF COURSE!!! Dinner served from 4pm, for menu see Renae's Pantry Facebook page (Friday) xxxx When: 3pm Address: 4-6 Main Street The Lane at Palmwoods See you all there! Some months we have special events, times, so to keep up to date with these like us on [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?ref=hl).
